# RR/Vite build output + the generated route types. `.react-router/types` is REGENERATED, never
# committed: `prepare` runs `react-router typegen` on every install, so a fresh clone has them
# before anything typechecks, and `react-router build` regenerates them again. They are ignored
# here rather than committed because a committed overlay is a hand-maintained overlay — it drifts
# from `routes.ts` silently, and the day it drifts it is still green.
/build/
/.react-router/
# @cloudflare/vite-plugin output.
/dist/
# Local dev secrets — never committed (CI needs no cloud credentials; every scene runs on Miniflare).
.dev.vars
.wrangler/
